rooms_desc ({"This is the hallway.To the west you notice Magicks bar and to the east i closed door.You see what looks like a study to the north.","You have entered Magicks bar.The walls are lined with exoticbottles from all over the mud-world.Perhaps you would like to sample a few?You also notice the large fridge wich keeps beer cool for any visitors.You see several couches inviting you to sit and relax.","You have entered Magicks bedroom.In the middle of the room you notice a large four-poster bed.To the south is a window and drawers.You also notice a photoon the drawers.A wardrobe is in the northern corner of the room.This room makes you feel very relaxed and happy.","This is Magicks study.She comes here to relax and think about quests.You notice the walls are covered in shelves of books.There is also a large desk and chair to the north of the room.On the desk you notice quest tropheys ","You have now entered the Gym.Along the walls you notice several fitness machines.There is also weights laying around.On the wall you notice a picture and a shield.","You have now gone out onto Magicks balcony.There are tables and chairs for you to sit and have your drink.You admire the view of the sea.You can see the sun setting to the west.This is the perfect place to sit after a hard days adventuring.","under repair","This is Magicks bathroom.Flowers border the room.It has a pink suite in it.You see a shower in the corner and fluffy towels beside it.","You notice a log fire burning in the corner giving the room a warm glow.There is a sofa to the south and a pictures on the wallsTo the west you see a window with a view of the sea.","You have entered Magicks private pool.The water looks so inviting you feel the urge to jump in.There are recliners against the walls if you just want to relax.A diving board in to the south of the pool.",})
